      "date": "2026-01-10T13:37:00.000Z",
      "title": "Sera Investments & Finance India Limited Announces Appointment of Sakshi Patel as Company Secretary and Compliance Officer, Effective January 10, 2026",
      "body": "The Board of Directors of Sera Investments & Finance India Limited at their meeting held on 10 January, 2026 has inter alia considered and approved the following: Appointment of M/s Sakshi Patel as the Company Secretary and compliance officer of the company with effect from January 10, 2026. M/s Sakshi Patel is a Company Secretary with a strong academic foundation in Law, She brings expertise in corporate governance, legal compliance, and secretarial practices, backed by practical experience as a trainee at Rutu Sanghavi & Associates and as a visiting faculty at H.M. Shah Institute Pvt. Ltd.",
